可以在这里洗！”然后，自己也撩起水，洗了洗自己的脸，把头发也弄湿，慢慢的清理。幡戈长得真是不错，清水洗去了他脸上的灰尘，五官更加清晰的展现出来，并不像历史书上画的原始人那般像大猩猩或者猴子！莫忆儿洗了洗脸，然后看向幡戈，他已经洗完了头发开始洗身子。看来，原始人也并不是完全不洗澡的，虽然平常没这个习惯，但是来到水边，还是会清理一下自己。接着……莫忆儿忙别过目光，脸‘腾’的一下子就红了起来，因为幡戈正在洗澡，还是好不遮羞的一把扯下腰间的兽皮，身体完完全全的暴露在莫忆儿面前，虽然只是看了一眼，但幡戈**那勃然大物莫忆儿还是看得清清楚楚，她敢肯定，那尺寸绝对堪比欧美人。幡戈自己折腾了好一会儿，哗啦啦的水声证明他洗的很欢快，直到全身都洗的干干净净，才注意到莫忆儿。便问：“你不是要洗兽皮和你自己，怎么还不洗？”莫忆儿心中哀嚎，难道想你一样没有羞耻心，在异性面前随便暴露下体吗？要是在二十一世纪，莫忆儿一定会上去给他一巴掌，大骂一声变态。可是在这里不行，原始人真的没有羞耻心，平时能在腰上围个兽皮裙已经不错了。她默默的为自己默哀，眼睛就这么被强jian了一次啊！“你，你先洗！”幡戈已经洗好了，而且身上的水珠都已经风干了，他微微不解的看了莫忆儿一会儿，把兽皮裙重新穿上，然后不确定的问：“你害羞了？你是女人吧……”莫忆儿顿时愤怒了，她刚刚听到了幡戈悉悉索索穿兽皮裙的声音，也没了顾忌，睁大了眼睛瞪向幡戈：“我不是女人还能是什么？我像男人吗？像吗？”她莫忆儿是个很娇柔可爱的女孩子好不好？就算偶尔凶巴巴了点，可她货真价实是个女孩子啊！就算胸前的两团肉比你们原始人小了点，但还是有的啊！为什么能这么不肯定的问呢？太打击她的小心肝了，伤自尊……显然，幡戈被忽然发飙的莫忆儿下了一大跳，忙解释：“你，你别生气，我，我是真的不太确定，你的……毛发太短，个子也不高，像是小孩子一样，而且你的兽皮太大，我看不到……你这里！”幡戈指了指莫忆儿的胸部，满脸无辜的表情。让莫忆儿心底更加抓狂，尼玛的，非要像你们这里的人一样都露出来才敢肯定？莫忆儿连续深呼吸了好几次，才让自己的情绪平静下来，不至于对幡戈使用暴力。“不管怎样，我要洗兽皮，还有我自己，你先离开，我记得回去的路，一会儿我自己可以回去！”幡戈闻言眉头微皱，脚下丝毫不动：“你要是害羞，我转过去不看你。”“你这是什么意思？监视我吗？为什么非要看住我？”莫忆儿对着幡戈怒吼，来了五天了，他们相处的还算是融洽，并且她感激这些原始人类给了自己食物和居住的地方，但这并不代表他们可以一直限制自己的自由。限制也就罢了，现在不过是想洗个澡，她是女孩子，一个大男人站在一边算什么？她有些暴躁，无法忍受下去。“不，你别生气！”幡戈又被她吓到，有些手足无措的样子，并且难得看出了他的一丝稚气，想必，面前这个男原始人年纪也不会大吧！“说，为什么要看住我？就因为我是你救回来的吗？你们想把我怎么办？”莫忆儿决定，要和幡戈摊牌了，虽然他说他不是首领，可首领不在，现在部落里面都是他说了算，问他总是没错的。“你别误会，我们只是怕你跑出去会有危险……还有，还有就是怕你会离开！”幡戈咬了咬唇，把他和族人们的担忧说了出来。“小剌剌告诉我说，你是从天上落下来的，咖萨说你一定是神灵的人，会给部落带来好运，所以请你不要离开我们部落，我们会好好招待你的，给你最好的食物，只要你别离开。”小剌剌就是那天扛着莫忆儿回来的小孩，但是在部族里面，他也算得上是个猎手了，每天和幡戈一起去打猎。他是亲眼看到莫忆儿从天上坠入到地面的，所以在莫忆儿叫住幡戈之后，幡戈把她带了回来，咖萨更是告诉幡戈一定要把莫忆儿留住，这样，部落会得到神灵的眷顾，好好对待神灵的人，神灵一定会给部落好运。莫忆儿明白了原委，顿时嘴角抽搐，尼玛，她不过是穿越过来一下，怎么就成了神灵的人？如果真有神灵，神灵一定是把她当做玩具了，否则为毛不让她穿越去做皇后、王妃、千金大小姐？对于这一点，莫忆儿还在耿耿于怀！", "source": "www.quanwenyuedu.io", "source_url": "https://www.quanwenyuedu.io/n/sifuzhengchong-mengguaifujunyangchengji/5.html", "_fixed": true, "content_en": "Chapter 5 Mo Yi'er was a little confused about the reason for being imprisoned. However, it was good to be able to look far away. With a man protecting her, it was relatively safe. \"I want to go to the river or the lake, somewhere with water!\" As she said that, Mo Yi'er smelled herself subconsciously. She had been here for five days. Apart from simply washing her face and gargling her mouth, she didn't even wash her hair. She also smelled a little bit of sweat, and her nightgown was also dirty. Ban Ge nodded and led Mo Yi'er out of the cave. With Ban Ge, no one stopped Mo Yi'er from walking. Ban Ge took her for ten minutes and saw their water source on the right side of the cave. It turned out to be a very small waterfall, about two meters high! The water flowed down, forming a shallow pool below. The water in the pool was green and clear, and some of the water overflowed the shallow pool and meandered down. Because there was not a lot of water, it only formed a very shallow stream. Ban Ge pointed at the shallow pool, with a smile on his face, and said: \"The tribesmen all get water here. What do you want to do here?\" Then he pointed at Mo Yi'er's pajamas: \"Are you going to wash this strange animal skin of yours?\" Animal skin? It turned out that these primitive people thought they were wearing animal skins, and they just thought it was a bit strange. \"Well, I want to wash the animal skins and myself!\" Mo Yi'er wanted to take a bath, but was afraid that Ban Ge wouldn't understand what a bath was. Bange nodded and took the lead, pulling Mo Yier to the overflowing place under the shallow pool, pointing at the water: \"You can wash here!\" Then, he also picked up the water, washed his face, got his hair wet, and slowly cleaned it up. Bange looks really good. The clean water washed away the dust on his face, and his facial features are more clearly displayed. He does not look like a gorilla or monkey like the primitive people painted in history books! Mo Yi'er washed her face, and then looked at Ban Ge. He had already finished washing his hair and started washing his body. It seems that primitive people did not avoid bathing at all. Although they did not usually have this habit, they would still clean themselves up when they came to the water. Then... Mo Yi'er quickly looked away, and her face suddenly turned red. Because Ban Ge was taking a bath, she still managed to pull off the animal skin around her waist without any shame, and her body was completely exposed in front of Mo Yi'er. Although she only glanced at it, Mo Yi'er could still clearly see Ban Ge's huge erection. She was sure that its size was comparable to that of Europeans and Americans. Bange worked on himself for a while, and the sound of rushing water proved that he was washing happily. He didn't notice Mo Yi'er until his whole body was washed clean. Then he asked: \"You don't want to wash the animal skin and yourself, why don't you wash it?\" Mo Yi'er wailed in her heart, do you think you have no shame and expose your private parts in front of the opposite sex? If he were in the 21st century, Mo Yi'er would definitely go up and give him a slap in the face and call him a pervert. But it doesn't work here. Primitive people really have no sense of shame. It's already good to wear an animal skin skirt around their waist. She silently mourned for herself, and her eyes were raped just once! \"You, you wash it first!\" Ban Ge had already washed it, and the water drops on his body had dried. He looked at Mo Yi'er slightly puzzled for a while, put the animal skin skirt back on, and then asked uncertainly: \"Are you shy? Are you a woman...\" Mo Yi'er suddenly said She was angry. She had just heard the sound of Ban Ge wearing an animal skin skirt, and she no longer had any scruples. She opened her eyes wide and stared at Ban Ge: \"What else can I be if I'm not a woman? Do I look like a man? Do I?\" She, Mo Yi'er, is a very delicate and lovely girl, okay? Even if she can be a bit fierce sometimes, she is really a girl! Even though the two lumps of flesh on your chest are a little smaller than those of you primitive people, they are still there! Why can you ask so uncertainly? It hit her heart so hard and hurt her self-esteem... Obviously, Ban Ge was taken aback by Mo Yi'er who suddenly went berserk. He hurriedly explained: \"Don't be angry, I, I'm really not sure, your... hair is too short, you are not tall, you look like a child, and your animal skin is too big, I can't see... you here!\" Ban Ge pointed at Mo Yi'er's chest, with an innocent expression on his face. It made Mo Yi'er even more crazy. Damn it, do you have to expose it like everyone else here to be sure? Mo Yi'er took deep breaths several times in a row to calm down her emotions and not use violence against Ban Ge. \"Anyway, I want to wash the animal skins and myself. You leave first. I will remember the way back. I can go back by myself in a while!\" Ban Ge frowned slightly when he heard this and did not move his feet at all: \"If you are shy, I will turn around and not look at you.\" \"What do you mean? Prisoner Are you looking after me? Why do you have to watch me?\" Mo Yi'er yelled at Ban Ge. They had been getting along well for five days, and she was grateful to these primitive humans for giving her food and a place to live, but this did not mean that they could always restrict their freedom. That's all the restrictions. Now she just wants to take a shower. She is a girl. What does it mean for a grown man to stand aside? She was a little irritable and couldn't stand it any longer. \"No, don't be angry!\" Bange was frightened by her again, looking a little at a loss, and it was rare to see a trace of childishness in him. Presumably, the male primitive man in front of him was not too old! \"Tell me, why do you want to keep an eye on me? Is it because you rescued me? What do you want to do with me?\" Mo Yi'er decided to have a showdown with Ban Ge. Although he said he was not the leader, the leader was not here. Now he had the final say in the tribe. It was always right to ask him. \"Don't get me wrong, we are just afraid that you will be in danger if you run out...and, we are also afraid that you will leave!\" Ban Ge bit his lip and expressed his and his clansmen's worries. \"Xiao Lala told me that you fell from the sky, and Kasa said that you must be a god.", "title_en": "Chapter 5"}